# Build outputs and local tooling state. Source (including .git, needed for
# version info) stays in the context so the Dockerfiles can build from source
# when TAR_FILE is not supplied. BuildKit only transfers files a build uses, so
# TAR_FILE builds still only send the distribution tarball.
**/build/
!build/distributions/
**/.gradle/
**/out/
.idea/
.vscode/
.fleet/
*.iml
docker/reports/
